  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. Lua fixture: file node named 'file' with span 1-1 (lua.py:882-891), and its functions get no contains edge. Ansible has the same shape (site.yml file 1-1, declarations to line 18, zero contains edges). Purescript is mis-diagnosed: the file spans 1-9 correctly and the module overshoots to 1-10 (end_point after the trailing newline, as in WI-nabaz). Other literal-1-1 file minters: yaml.py, base.py, websocket/js_module/vue_component linkers. MECHANISM: analyzers mint file nodes with placeholder Span(1,1); purescript module span uses root end_point (N+1 after trailing newline). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-nabaz,WI-budoh."  # 672f
